(6958512, 1049592, 157652, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but the colors are too close to grays for this challenge, IMO. Might work in black and white?</td>', 'Nice image, but the colors are too close to grays for this challenge, IMO. Might work in black and white?', '2013-01-16 01:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
