(6958530, 1049431, 157652, '<td valign="top">That''s a big backpack :P I like this picture, but it would''ve been better IMO if there weren''t so many colorful things to compete for the viewer''s attention (yellow shirt, reddish dirt, green water, blue sky).</td>', 'That''s a big backpack :P I like this picture, but it would''ve been better IMO if there weren''t so many colorful things to compete for the viewer''s attention (yellow shirt, reddish dirt, green water, blue sky).', '2013-01-16 02:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6958531, 1049296, 157652, '<td valign="top">Very cool :) I like how you adjusted the aspect ratio to fit your subject. A close-up of just the front might''ve worked too.</td>', 'Very cool :) I like how you adjusted the aspect ratio to fit your subject. A close-up of just the front might''ve worked too.', '2013-01-16 02:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
