(6958974, 1049403, 153814, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to read the comments on this you must be getting some beauties.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'I can''t wait to read the comments on this you must be getting some beauties.Good luck.', '2013-01-16 11:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6958977, 1049612, 153814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image but I just dont see how it fits the challenge.<br/>I don''t know if the sky''s the subject or it''s supposed to offset everthing else.</td>', 'Beautiful image but I just dont see how it fits the challenge.I don''t know if the sky''s the subject or it''s supposed to offset everthing else.', '2013-01-16 11:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6958994, 1049334, 30712, '<td valign="top">A great shot. A simple combination of great light and interesting textures.</td>', 'A great shot. A simple combination of great light and interesting textures.', '2013-01-16 11:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6958996, 1049074, 30712, '<td valign="top">This is a pure delight.  It''s what this challenge is all about.</td>', 'This is a pure delight.  It''s what this challenge is all about.', '2013-01-16 11:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6958999, 1049590, 30712, '<td valign="top">A simple idea but it works so well.</td>', 'A simple idea but it works so well.', '2013-01-16 11:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959000, 1049593, 30712, '<td valign="top">Simplicity creating perfection.</td>', 'Simplicity creating perfection.', '2013-01-16 11:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959002, 1049371, 30712, '<td valign="top">A little too much formality knocked this image down a notch but it is still very appealing.</td>', 'A little too much formality knocked this image down a notch but it is still very appealing.', '2013-01-16 11:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959004, 1049224, 30712, '<td valign="top">These umbrellas keep appearing and this image proves their worth.</td>', 'These umbrellas keep appearing and this image proves their worth.', '2013-01-16 11:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959007, 1048926, 30712, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred the background to have been desaturated so that there was a hint of colour left.  The contrast between the brilliant umbrella and the monochrome is a bit over the top.  It''s still a great image.</td>', 'I would have preferred the background to have been desaturated so that there was a hint of colour left.  The contrast between the brilliant umbrella and the monochrome is a bit over the top.  It''s still a great image.', '2013-01-16 11:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959008, 1049344, 153814, '<td valign="top">I think i found color, is that a bus.</td>', 'I think i found color, is that a bus.', '2013-01-16 11:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959009, 1049541, 153814, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked alot better with a different color background.</td>', 'I think this would have looked alot better with a different color background.', '2013-01-16 11:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959010, 1049464, 116575, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I love the colors.</td>', 'Very nice, I love the colors.', '2013-01-16 11:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959011, 1048956, 30712, '<td valign="top">The way the creature and leaf match tonally makes for perfection.  I just want to keep looking.</td>', 'The way the creature and leaf match tonally makes for perfection.  I just want to keep looking.', '2013-01-16 11:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959012, 1049657, 153814, '<td valign="top">Am I missing something.</td>', 'Am I missing something.', '2013-01-16 11:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959013, 1049677, 153814, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.</td>', 'I don''t get it.', '2013-01-16 11:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959015, 1049534, 30712, '<td valign="top">The overall brightness of the apple has no background to stand out against which I feel was the whole point of the challenge.  If the apple was against a darker background then the apple would shout,"Look at me!"</td>', 'The overall brightness of the apple has no background to stand out against which I feel was the whole point of the challenge.  If the apple was against a darker background then the apple would shout,"Look at me!"', '2013-01-16 11:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959016, 1048883, 153814, '<td valign="top">Really nice colors in this.<br/>Not bad I see the dark bridge being offset by the colorful sky.<br/>Kind of an inverted take on the challenge.<br/>Took me a while.</td>', 'Really nice colors in this.Not bad I see the dark bridge being offset by the colorful sky.Kind of an inverted take on the challenge.Took me a while.', '2013-01-16 11:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959018, 1049496, 153814, '<td valign="top">I see how it fits the challenge but it doesn''t really hold my interest.<br/></td>', 'I see how it fits the challenge but it doesn''t really hold my interest.', '2013-01-16 11:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959021, 1049295, 77196, '<td valign="top">Multnomah Falls - great place for pictures! I love the bright red jacket against the muted colors in the rest of the picture. Must have been cold with all the ice to either side of the falls.</td>', 'Multnomah Falls - great place for pictures! I love the bright red jacket against the muted colors in the rest of the picture. Must have been cold with all the ice to either side of the falls.', '2013-01-16 11:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959022, 1049078, 30712, '<td valign="top">With this picture being blue all over, I find no colour bursting out from a contrasting background which to my mind was the point of the challenge.</td>', 'With this picture being blue all over, I find no colour bursting out from a contrasting background which to my mind was the point of the challenge.', '2013-01-16 11:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959023, 1049592, 30712, '<td valign="top">I''m looking for that burst of contrasting colour, demanded by the wording of the challenge, but I can''t find one unfortunately.</td>', 'I''m looking for that burst of contrasting colour, demanded by the wording of the challenge, but I can''t find one unfortunately.', '2013-01-16 11:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959024, 1049695, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the web, but too much stuff in the shot, IMO. A tighter crop and better defined single subject might work better. The trees / leaves / branches in the background are distracting to me.</td>', 'Love the web, but too much stuff in the shot, IMO. A tighter crop and better defined single subject might work better. The trees / leaves / branches in the background are distracting to me.', '2013-01-16 11:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959025, 1049647, 77196, '<td valign="top">Simple. Effective. I like the tie-in of the numbers and the background.</td>', 'Simple. Effective. I like the tie-in of the numbers and the background.', '2013-01-16 11:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959026, 1049657, 30712, '<td valign="top">Delightful though this scene is I don''t thing that the brighter colours "burst" and hit the eye with impact.</td>', 'Delightful though this scene is I don''t thing that the brighter colours "burst" and hit the eye with impact.', '2013-01-16 11:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959027, 1049363, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Lots and lots of nice, bright colors, with the central subject being the water droplets.</td>', 'Nice shot. Lots and lots of nice, bright colors, with the central subject being the water droplets.', '2013-01-16 11:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959029, 1048635, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1, the clear winner, at least I hope. <br/>Nothing really to add as this stands miles ahead of the other entries, including my own!</td>', '#1, the clear winner, at least I hope. Nothing really to add as this stands miles ahead of the other entries, including my own!', '2013-01-16 11:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959030, 1049711, 77196, '<td valign="top">Definitely bright, but something just doesn''t work in the shot. I''m thinking that leaving out the marbles might have helped - they are difficult to recognize immediately, and are more like background interruptions of the image rather than subject matter. But, I think you are onto something with the contrast of long &amp; straight with short &amp; round - worth playing around with, perhaps with a more ordered arrangement.</td>', 'Definitely bright, but something just doesn''t work in the shot. I''m thinking that leaving out the marbles might have helped - they are difficult to recognize immediately, and are more like background interruptions of the image rather than subject matter. But, I think you are onto something with the contrast of long & straight with short & round - worth playing around with, perhaps with a more ordered arrangement.', '2013-01-16 12:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959031, 1049541, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting sculpture, but for this challenge, I''d tone the grass way down or lose it altogether - it competes with the dog for brightest color.</td>', 'Interesting sculpture, but for this challenge, I''d tone the grass way down or lose it altogether - it competes with the dog for brightest color.', '2013-01-16 12:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959032, 1048956, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the DOF and good, sharp focus on its face. The orange definitely stands out from an otherwise mostly uniform tan/brown shot.</td>', 'Great shot. I like the DOF and good, sharp focus on its face. The orange definitely stands out from an otherwise mostly uniform tan/brown shot.', '2013-01-16 12:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959033, 1049511, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset (sunrise?), but IMO the black poles &amp; wires block &amp; distract rather than add to. Interesting lines in the clouds, also - almost didn''t notice them at all...</td>', 'Nice sunset (sunrise?), but IMO the black poles & wires block & distract rather than add to. Interesting lines in the clouds, also - almost didn''t notice them at all...', '2013-01-16 12:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959034, 1049709, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice flower shot.</td>', 'Very nice flower shot.', '2013-01-16 12:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959036, 1048926, 77196, '<td valign="top">Ah, selective desat! It does make the umbrella colors stand out. IMO, a plainer  background would work better.</td>', 'Ah, selective desat! It does make the umbrella colors stand out. IMO, a plainer  background would work better.', '2013-01-16 12:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959037, 1049385, 77196, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a poppy to me. Interesting shot - I like how the color explodes outwards onto / over the white background. 8</td>', 'Looks more like a poppy to me. Interesting shot - I like how the color explodes outwards onto / over the white background. 8', '2013-01-16 12:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959043, 1049612, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not buying it for the challenge - the blue is not intense enough, and blends with the rest of the shot rather than being an emphasis. However, this is an absolutely gorgeous photo. I especially like the big fir on the left 1/3 line as an anchor and balance to the mountain peak on the right 1/3. Wonderful motion patterns in the water, and great color on the bushes. Looks like the unspoiled wilderness, right down to no human tracks in the snow! 7</td>', 'Not buying it for the challenge - the blue is not intense enough, and blends with the rest of the shot rather than being an emphasis. However, this is an absolutely gorgeous photo. I especially like the big fir on the left 1/3 line as an anchor and balance to the mountain peak on the right 1/3. Wonderful motion patterns in the water, and great color on the bushes. Looks like the unspoiled wilderness, right down to no human tracks in the snow! 7', '2013-01-16 12:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959044, 1049360, 77196, '<td valign="top">Run children! Beware of the exploding flower! Very nice concept - nicely done.</td>', 'Run children! Beware of the exploding flower! Very nice concept - nicely done.', '2013-01-16 12:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959047, 1049392, 77196, '<td valign="top">That''s enough to even make Grog hungry! I love the colors, and the visual depth to the image - a 3-D effect without glasses - the droplets really look like they''re hanging in mid-air. 10</td>', 'That''s enough to even make Grog hungry! I love the colors, and the visual depth to the image - a 3-D effect without glasses - the droplets really look like they''re hanging in mid-air. 10', '2013-01-16 12:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959050, 1048883, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Not sure about the brush in the right foreground.</td>', 'Nice colors. Not sure about the brush in the right foreground.', '2013-01-16 12:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959051, 1049635, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice, subdued flower shot. Gentle blending of shades of purple.</td>', 'Nice, subdued flower shot. Gentle blending of shades of purple.', '2013-01-16 12:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959053, 1048698, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like the shadows that emphasize the shape of the octagon.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like the shadows that emphasize the shape of the octagon.', '2013-01-16 12:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959058, 1049496, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of the post. Interesting use of partial objects intruding into the background, but they distract from the central pole. For example, the partial chair, Wi- partial word, shelf edge (all on the right), the partial door (center - especially with the multiple panels), painting, man''s shoulder, round table, overstuffed chair (all left). That being said, it is in focus, and pretty much level.</td>', 'Nice picture of the post. Interesting use of partial objects intruding into the background, but they distract from the central pole. For example, the partial chair, Wi- partial word, shelf edge (all on the right), the partial door (center - especially with the multiple panels), painting, man''s shoulder, round table, overstuffed chair (all left). That being said, it is in focus, and pretty much level.', '2013-01-16 12:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959060, 1049226, 77196, '<td valign="top">Blurry. All blurry. Nice colors, but all blurry. Nice sense of motion.</td>', 'Blurry. All blurry. Nice colors, but all blurry. Nice sense of motion.', '2013-01-16 12:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959061, 1049078, 77196, '<td valign="top">I think ''e got me! Nice capture - does not look like it was easy.</td>', 'I think ''e got me! Nice capture - does not look like it was easy.', '2013-01-16 12:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959063, 1049019, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective - I like the red against the black background.</td>', 'Interesting perspective - I like the red against the black background.', '2013-01-16 12:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959065, 1049603, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice color - love the orange / yellows. I''m wondering what it would look like fill-the-frame, with very little or no green.</td>', 'Nice color - love the orange / yellows. I''m wondering what it would look like fill-the-frame, with very little or no green.', '2013-01-16 12:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959066, 1048899, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice ethereal effect and great colors</td>', 'Nice ethereal effect and great colors', '2013-01-16 12:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959068, 1049340, 118154, '<td valign="top">A nice image that fits the challenge and pleases the eye.</td>', 'A nice image that fits the challenge and pleases the eye.', '2013-01-16 12:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959069, 1049179, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nominate this guy for Father of the Year. Hopefully the traffic was stopped. As I found out, the child is quicker than the parent, and does not always cooperate for their own safety. Looks like it needed just a tad faster shutter speed to stop child / dad''s motion, although having them a bit blurry compared to the in-focus surroundings isn''t too bad an idea.</td>', 'Nominate this guy for Father of the Year. Hopefully the traffic was stopped. As I found out, the child is quicker than the parent, and does not always cooperate for their own safety. Looks like it needed just a tad faster shutter speed to stop child / dad''s motion, although having them a bit blurry compared to the in-focus surroundings isn''t too bad an idea.', '2013-01-16 12:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959071, 1049545, 77196, '<td valign="top">Oh, no, no, no! I love the shadow patterns. I love the bright red jacket. I love the marred concrete block wall. And I especially love the old rusted headboard. I even think it might have all worked OK together IF the top part of the jacket wasn''t in shadow - either all in the shadow, or all in the sunlight, but not bisected. 5</td>', 'Oh, no, no, no! I love the shadow patterns. I love the bright red jacket. I love the marred concrete block wall. And I especially love the old rusted headboard. I even think it might have all worked OK together IF the top part of the jacket wasn''t in shadow - either all in the shadow, or all in the sunlight, but not bisected. 5', '2013-01-16 12:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959072, 1049671, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great colors and patterns. Too soft and diffused for me.</td>', 'Great colors and patterns. Too soft and diffused for me.', '2013-01-16 12:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959073, 1049372, 77196, '<td valign="top">The star effect is so strong and dominant that it takes away from the rest of the image.</td>', 'The star effect is so strong and dominant that it takes away from the rest of the image.', '2013-01-16 12:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959074, 1049630, 77196, '<td valign="top">Different. At least it is dark enough that you are not looking up his nostrils. I like the red/black contrast, though I''m not really believing campfire as the light source.</td>', 'Different. At least it is dark enough that you are not looking up his nostrils. I like the red/black contrast, though I''m not really believing campfire as the light source.', '2013-01-16 12:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959075, 1049233, 77196, '<td valign="top">A striking image - great color on the boats, nice scenic background. The red post on shore is a bit distracting.</td>', 'A striking image - great color on the boats, nice scenic background. The red post on shore is a bit distracting.', '2013-01-16 12:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959076, 1049020, 77196, '<td valign="top">Life doesn''t give me lemons - I have to buy them! Matter of taste - I think this might want a bit deeper DOF (like from navel through back water drop). Still, a very nice shot.</td>', 'Life doesn''t give me lemons - I have to buy them! Matter of taste - I think this might want a bit deeper DOF (like from navel through back water drop). Still, a very nice shot.', '2013-01-16 12:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959079, 1049149, 77196, '<td valign="top">Shirt bottom not even on purpose? I think there are enough clues that this is a guy without it. The pink against the fog is very nice. It also bothers me that it seems cold enough to need a long-sleeved shirt under the pink one, but he''s wearing shorts with bare legs. I guess the subtle huh?''s make you stop, look, and think.</td>', 'Shirt bottom not even on purpose? I think there are enough clues that this is a guy without it. The pink against the fog is very nice. It also bothers me that it seems cold enough to need a long-sleeved shirt under the pink one, but he''s wearing shorts with bare legs. I guess the subtle huh?''s make you stop, look, and think.', '2013-01-16 12:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6959081, 1049429, 77196, '<td valign="top">While the tree branches in the background are in sharp focus, the umbrella is OOF and the back lighting of the underside washes out the colors. Interesting concept, though.</td>', 'While the tree branches in the background are in sharp focus, the umbrella is OOF and the back lighting of the underside washes out the colors. Interesting concept, though.', '2013-01-16 12:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
