(6960850, 1049216, 10594, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would get a lot more impact if you cropped out the boats and houses on the opposite shore, leaving just the water.</td>', 'I think this picture would get a lot more impact if you cropped out the boats and houses on the opposite shore, leaving just the water.', '2013-01-19 01:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
