(6961154, 1049612, 112539, '<td valign="top">Hard to know how to judge this one. The photo is gorgeous! But...the little bit of blue in the sky doesn''t speak to me as a burst of color that is offsetting anything. So I have judge the photo in the context of the challenge but I think I will only deduct a point cause I love the photo so much. Maybe I should focus more on the challenge category but nahhh. I love this.</td>', 'Hard to know how to judge this one. The photo is gorgeous! But...the little bit of blue in the sky doesn''t speak to me as a burst of color that is offsetting anything. So I have judge the photo in the context of the challenge but I think I will only deduct a point cause I love the photo so much. Maybe I should focus more on the challenge category but nahhh. I love this.', '2013-01-19 19:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
