(6962929, 1049470, 96751, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by adriano74:</b></div><hr/><i> Gee let me see:<br/>Bright beautiful flower - check<br/>Bright photogenic bird - check<br/>Vibrance and patience of the 2 together with a perfect black background - check<br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>AND a head tilt...<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Originally posted by adriano74: Gee let me see:Bright beautiful flower - checkBright photogenic bird - checkVibrance and patience of the 2 together with a perfect black background - check  AND a head tilt... Congrats on the ribbon.', '2013-01-23 00:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6962931, 1049139, 108580, '<td valign="top">6.6 seems rather low for a superbly lit floral study. They <u>are</u> as boldly red and green as this in their natural state. In fact you have to tone down the saturation to get today''s sensors and LCD''s to show the detail and veins as the red blows out in places. WD Oliver.</td>', '6.6 seems rather low for a superbly lit floral study. They are as boldly red and green as this in their natural state. In fact you have to tone down the saturation to get today''s sensors and LCD''s to show the detail and veins as the red blows out in places. WD Oliver.', '2013-01-23 00:33:42.000000', NULL, 0),
