(6962998, 1049074, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Giles_uk:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cuttooth:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Giles_uk:</b></div><hr/><i> Great shot, congratulations on the blue :) I gave it a ten was it shot from a jetty or another boat </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks everyone!<br/> <br/>This was shot from the water.  The tide was really high so I''m about mid torso deep here. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>do you have a waterproof housing/wet bag/just brave </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hehe, just brave.<br/>This is a shot from last year that was taken of me while taking boat shots at this same spot. The tide was much higher when I took the burst of color shot though.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014385" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96574/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014385.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96574/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014385.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96574/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014385.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by Giles_uk: Originally posted by Cuttooth: Originally posted by Giles_uk: Great shot, congratulations on the blue :) I gave it a ten was it shot from a jetty or another boat   Thanks everyone! This was shot from the water.  The tide was really high so I''m about mid torso deep here.   do you have a waterproof housing/wet bag/just brave   Hehe, just brave.This is a shot from last year that was taken of me while taking boat shots at this same spot. The tide was much higher when I took the burst of color shot though.', '2013-01-23 02:52:57.000000', NULL, 0),
