(6963156, 1048635, 138253, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to welcome you to DPC - you started here on the right foot, with a blue ribbon on your first entry!!<br/>Seems like you''ve got a great eye for this and have willing (or are willing to pay for) models for your work. Congratulations and welcome!<br/>I really like the composition and colors in the image and feel it''s well deserving of the ribbon.</td>', 'Just wanted to welcome you to DPC - you started here on the right foot, with a blue ribbon on your first entry!!Seems like you''ve got a great eye for this and have willing (or are willing to pay for) models for your work. Congratulations and welcome!I really like the composition and colors in the image and feel it''s well deserving of the ribbon.', '2013-01-23 10:52:40.000000', NULL, 0),
