(6963196, 1048635, 73828, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Giles_uk:</b></div><hr/><i> Great start on here and great shot hope this gets validated as he uploaded it to his Facebook cover photo on dec 31st so hopefully he reshot it within the timeframe. <br/> <br/>Be shame to see such a beautiful pic get dq''d <br/> <br/>Bet it was messy in the studio hehe, </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Shame? What shame?? <br/>Well... he also posted this picture on Deviantart on the 30st of december or even before. <br/>I wonder how old is this shot...? <br/>"stavraham.deviantart.com/#/d5pu1tm" <br/>Anyway, rules have to be applied because they DO actually exist here and it is not a shame to see it dq´d because without rules this "game" would not be so interesting. <br/>He will have many chances to get familiarized with all of them. And there are plenty, do you agree?</td>', 'Originally posted by Giles_uk: Great start on here and great shot hope this gets validated as he uploaded it to his Facebook cover photo on dec 31st so hopefully he reshot it within the timeframe.  Be shame to see such a beautiful pic get dq''d  Bet it was messy in the studio hehe,   Shame? What shame?? Well... he also posted this picture on Deviantart on the 30st of december or even before. I wonder how old is this shot...? "stavraham.deviantart.com/#/d5pu1tm" Anyway, rules have to be applied because they DO actually exist here and it is not a shame to see it dq´d because without rules this "game" would not be so interesting. He will have many chances to get familiarized with all of them. And there are plenty, do you agree?', '2013-01-23 11:53:02.000000', NULL, 0),
