(6963256, 1049216, 10785, '<td valign="top"><b>Greeting from the Comment Bomb Squad</b> <br/> <br/>I am just going through some of your photo''s to find some with few comments to give you some more feedback.<br/> <br/>Here I find a shot that meets the challenge well enough however the amount of color given off by the small subject in such a large backdrop doesn''t give off that real burst. The use of such a large aperture didn''t leave much else to look at in the shot with the entire background being out of focus a bit too much. I would agree with the first commenter below, using a landscape orientation, putting the beach line on te top third line and the berries in the bottom left intersection of the third lines would have given more impact.</td>', 'Greeting from the Comment Bomb Squad  I am just going through some of your photo''s to find some with few comments to give you some more feedback. Here I find a shot that meets the challenge well enough however the amount of color given off by the small subject in such a large backdrop doesn''t give off that real burst. The use of such a large aperture didn''t leave much else to look at in the shot with the entire background being out of focus a bit too much. I would agree with the first commenter below, using a landscape orientation, putting the beach line on te top third line and the berries in the bottom left intersection of the third lines would have given more impact.', '2013-01-23 13:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6963272, 1048635, 101702, '<td valign="top">Great image and was my pick of the bunch... I was one of your 10''s. Now that the challenge has closed, and I see you are a first time entrant, I worry that a blue ribbon with a first entry is almost a sure sign that a disqualification is on the way... sort a rite-of-passage. <br/> <br/>Sure enough the image pre-dates the challenge period and therefore won''t pass validation. Please don''t be disheartened by this, and continue to submit excellent images such as this one. Welcome to DPC!</td>', 'Great image and was my pick of the bunch... I was one of your 10''s. Now that the challenge has closed, and I see you are a first time entrant, I worry that a blue ribbon with a first entry is almost a sure sign that a disqualification is on the way... sort a rite-of-passage.  Sure enough the image pre-dates the challenge period and therefore won''t pass validation. Please don''t be disheartened by this, and continue to submit excellent images such as this one. Welcome to DPC!', '2013-01-23 13:25:27.000000', NULL, 0),
