(6963687, 1049320, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in this challenges, perhaps because it takes the seemingly mundane and makes it into a science fiction device with infinity blue screens or dials or tubes, and the look and feel of the woman in the upper left corner is impossibly thin, almost alien in that respect. (even if all that was unintended, especially with the matter of fact- near tongue-in -cheek 50''s era ad slogan of a title)</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in this challenges, perhaps because it takes the seemingly mundane and makes it into a science fiction device with infinity blue screens or dials or tubes, and the look and feel of the woman in the upper left corner is impossibly thin, almost alien in that respect. (even if all that was unintended, especially with the matter of fact- near tongue-in -cheek 50''s era ad slogan of a title)', '2013-01-24 08:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
